    {
      "id": "sec_s4l13_r2",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "'أَنَا' (ana) zameer-e-munfasil wahid mutakallim (main) ke liye aati hai. Jab kisi ism se pehle 'أَنَا' lagaya jaye toh mukammal jumla banta hai, jaise: أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Main Yusuf hoon), أَنَا نَذِيرٌ (Main darane / khabardar karne wala hoon).",
        "content": "'أَنَا' (ana) zameer-e-munfasil wahid mutakallim (main) ke liye aati hai. Jab kisi ism se pehle 'أَنَا' lagaya jaye toh mukammal jumla banta hai, jaise: أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Main Yusuf hoon), أَنَا نَذِيرٌ (Main darane / khabardar karne wala hoon).",
        "hinglish_text": "'أَنَا' (ana) zameer-e-munfasil wahid mutakallim (main) ke liye aati hai. Jab kisi ism se pehle 'أَنَا' lagaya jaye toh mukammal jumla banta hai, jaise: أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Main Yusuf hoon), أَنَا نَذِيرٌ (Main darane / khabardar karne wala hoon)."
